      "content": "hey so i've been having these really bad leg cramps and feeling super wiped out lately. i know i have stage 3 kidney disease so i try to be careful, but i read online that sometimes these symptoms mean potassium is low. if i got those 99mg potassium supplements, how many should i take a day to really get it working fast? like is it okay to take like 6 or 7 of them daily to fix it quickly?",
